# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════
# JobPilot — Environment Variables
# Copy to .env.local for local dev, add to Vercel for prod
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════

# REQUIRED — OpenRouter API Key
# Powers: AI scoring, resume tailoring, cover letters, interview prep, diagnostics
# Get key: https://openrouter.ai/keys (free to start)
# Cost: ~₹0.05–0.50 per full scan
OPENROUTER_API_KEY=sk-or-v1-your-key-here

# RECOMMENDED — JSearch (RapidAPI) Key
# Powers: Real jobs from LinkedIn, Indeed, Glassdoor
# Without it: only Greenhouse company boards load (still functional)
# Get key: https://rapidapi.com/letscrape-6baf1d1cef0b/api/jsearch
# Cost: Free (200 req/month) → Basic $10/month (500 req)
JSEARCH_API_KEY=your-rapidapi-key-here
